  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Food Security pilot 2015-16</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRC is providing scale up funding to SRC for its response to the growing food crisis in two areas in NE Senegal under teh objectives of the IFRC Senegal appeal. A total of 750 Very Poor families will be targetted for emergency nutritional support through the provision of vouchers which can be exchanged for food at selected merchants. Additionally 600 households will be targetted for livelihoods programming aiming to strengthen and diversify households and improve their resilience. The intention is to use this pooject as a pilot and encourage P2P exchanges amongst NS in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
